DRAFT, UNTESTED. T1070.001 - Clear Windows Event Logs
Security 1102 = Security log cleared. System 104 would cover other logs if collected.
Works even though the attacker wiped the local log, because the forwarder already shipped earlier events and logs the clear itself.
```
index=wineventlog EventCode=1102
| table _time host Message


